.DS_Store
node_modules/
*.log
.gstack/
.omc/

# PNG masters for the artwork. The site only ever loads the .webp — those are
# tracked and are the deliverable; these originals are ~10x the size and no
# page requests them. The repo is deployed by `git checkout` onto the live web
# server (deploy/README.md), so anything committed here also ships there.
# Keep the masters locally, or archive them outside the repo.
assets/*.png
assets/screenshots/*.png
assets/Streams of tiny luminous motes

# …except the PNGs the site genuinely serves: favicons, app/manifest icons,
# and the social card. (Already-tracked files are unaffected by .gitignore
# either way; these negations are so a NEW one doesn't get silently ignored.)
!assets/favicon-*.png
!assets/app-icon*.png
!assets/apple-touch-icon.png
!assets/icon-*.png
!assets/og-image.png
